// =============================================================
// Exercise 2 - Baseline query: noisy failed sign-ins
// =============================================================
// Goal: find accounts with > 10 failed sign-in attempts in 24h.
// Use this as the starting point before extending to impossible travel.
//
// Where to paste: Microsoft Sentinel > Logs
// Required table: SigninLogs (Azure AD / Entra ID connector)
// =============================================================

SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where ResultType != 0                       // 0 = success, anything else = failure
| summarize
    FailedAttempts = count(),
    DistinctIPs   = dcount(IPAddress),
    Countries     = make_set(tostring(LocationDetails.countryOrRegion), 10)
    by UserPrincipalName
| where FailedAttempts > 10
| sort by FailedAttempts desc
